{
 "id": 660688,
 "titulo": "2.8.0 Update Details   [#26 has been added to other improvements]",
 "fecha": 1484028046457,
 "modificada": 1732956093148,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/660688",
 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">With all the recent teasers, we&rsquo;re pretty sure you know which characters will be making their way into Marvel Future Fight 2.8.0! However, there is still so much more to reveal, including deleteing #HulkNeedsABetterUpgrade. What are we waiting for, let&rsquo;s dive into the information! &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;<img id=\"OGq_1xXEeuU\" class=\"youtube_thumb\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OGq_1xXEeuU/sddefault.jpg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> 3 New Characters</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">A Queen and 2 young prot&eacute;g&eacute;s will be added to the roster this patch. Hawkeye (Kate Bishop), Ironheart, and Medusa join the Fight!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/01.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #c00000; font-size: 10pt;\">*&nbsp;Numbers are based on skill level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #c00000; font-size: 10pt;\">*<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>Hawkeye (Kate Bishop) is available through Villain Siege.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -6.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.5; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 6.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #c00000; font-size: 10pt;\">*<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;Ironheart </span>will be available only in the Get 20 Biometrics Daily package available in the shop.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"apple-converted-space\"><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">* </span></span><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">Medusa is available through Hero Chests!</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">New Team Bonuses and Achievements have been added.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> 2 New 6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">★</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Skills</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">Bullseye and Elektra will get their <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">6</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">★</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Skill.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/02.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> 3 New Tier-2 Skills</span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Hulk (Amadeus Cho), Bullseye and Elektra will get their Tier-2 Skills.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/03.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0070c0;\">[Advancement?]</span></strong><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;A character which is Advanced from Tier-1 to Tier-2 will gain a stat increase, as well as a new passive skill.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> 5 New Uniforms</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">New Uniforms for Captain America, Red Hulk, Yellowjacket, Hulk (Amadeus Cho), and Squirrel Girl have been added. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/04.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"> <br /> <span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Uniform Upgrade</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Customize the power of your uniforms with the all new Uniform Upgrade function! </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Upgrading uniforms will give a boost to your All Attack and All Defense of that character, as well as giving you new options for your Uniform. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1. Conditions</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1) Reach 100% Uniform EXP</strong> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 12.0pt; text-indent: -12.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - Similar to Hero EXP, Uniform EXP can be obtained whilst your character (wearing the Uniform) runs stages. New Uniform EXP Chips have been added to help you gain Uniform EXP.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>2) Required Uniform</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong>- Uniform Rank Up requires other Uniforms as a requirement to advance. The required Uniform is only a condition, not a material, which means the uniform will not be consumed in the process of ranking up your uniform. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>3) Upgrade Material</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp; - Gold and other materials will be necessary to upgrade a Uniform.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/05.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>2. Uniform Rank</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">New Uniform Ranks have been added. These ranks follow the usual Rank system as found in Cards. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 12.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Normal &gt;<span style=\"color: #00b050;\">Advanced</span> &gt; <span style=\"color: #00b0f0;\">Rare</span> &gt; <span style=\"color: #7030a0;\">Heroic</span> &gt; <span style=\"color: #e36c0a; mso-themecolor: accent6; mso-themeshade: 191;\">Legendary</span> &gt; <span style=\"color: red;\">Mythical</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>3. Option Change</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">If your Uniform&rsquo;s rank is Advanced or higher, you will be able to change the additional options to fit your playstyle. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/06.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">It will require a&nbsp;certain amount of gold to change.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Change All &#98;utton for Gear Option</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">To reduce the tediousness of rolling gear stats, Gear Options can now be changed all at once with Change All &#98;utton.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">1) &#83;elect the gear that you want to change the option of and press the [Change All] &#98;utton</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">2) &#83;elect the desired option and press [Change All (X10)] &#98;utton to change</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">3) It will be changed into the &#115;elected option. However if the option is not changed within 10 times, you may need to reroll.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/07.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> ISO-8 Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">After the update, ISO-8 management will be made easier! </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1. Required ISO-8 for Set Effects</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">You will be able to check required ISO-8 and the amount you need to equip to reach the equipped ISO-8 set. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/08.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>2. Quick Upgrade</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Using Quick Upgrade &#98;utton to upgrade ISO-8 to +5 at once. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/09.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Quick Upgrade will use ISO-8 that is a lower rank than itself.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">The materials for the upgraded ISO-8&rsquo;s will be used from the lowest ISO-8 to the highest (1★, then 2★ etc). </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #c00000;\">* 1.5 times feature will not be available in Quick Upgrade</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #c00000;\">* Use Lock feature if you don&rsquo;t wish to use certain ISO-8!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #c00000;\">* ISO-8 that are used as material will disappear.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Character Balancing</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>1. Elektra</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Tier-1 Stats has been slightly improved</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">1) Tier-1 Passive Skill &ndash; Assasin&rsquo;s Instinct</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- Stat Increased [3% &gt; 10%]</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">2) Elektra&rsquo;s stats have been improved.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">3) Active Skills &ndash; Elektra has finally decided to hit the Dojo, and has learned a new skill set.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: .25in; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101414/10.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: .25in; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: .25in; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* Numbers are based on Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 40.0pt; text-indent: .25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>2. Hulk</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;1) </strong>Tier-1 and Tier-2 Passive Skill has been changed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/11.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>3. Red Hulk</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;1) </strong>Tier-1 and Tier-2 Passive Skill has been changed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/12.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>4. Captain America (including Uniforms)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">1) Shield Throw</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;- Damage Increased</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">2) Valor</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;- Damage Increased</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">3) Heroic Fury</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;- Damage Increased</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">4) Stat increase to Tier-1, HP increases for Tier-2</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">5) Tier-1 and Tier-2 Passive Skill Changes</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/13.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* Numbers are based on Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>5. Squirrel Girl (including Uniform)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">1) Squirrel Army</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;- Army of Squirrels will now hit all opponents in their path</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>6. Bullseye (including Uniform)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">1) Storm of Sword</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;- Swords will now hit all characters in the skills path </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">2) Assassination</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;-Instant I-&#102;rame added in certain animation. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"> Other Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">1. &nbsp;Added new security measures </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">2. Doctor Strange&rsquo;s Uniform Option has been reverted back from Super Armor to Reflect Damage.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">3. Damage Reflecting will work after Damage Immune buff activated.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">4. Find Hero menu will now keep your place in the list after you &#115;elect a character and press the back &#98;utton. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">5. Uru and Uniform Upgrade guide has been added in game</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">6. Black Panther&rsquo;s skill &lsquo;Predator Frenzy&rsquo; will have a new icon</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">7. Fixed an issue with Hulk (Amadeus Cho)&rsquo;s Battle Intro Animation showing a missing texture.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">8. Gwenpool Biometrics will no longer be available in World Boss Invasion Chests.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">9. Villain Siege(Hard) Hulk (Amadeus Cho) Reward Biometrics will be replaced with Hawkeye (Kate Bishop).</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">10. Fixed an issue where locked Custom Gear is not equipable to characters without Custom Gear equipped</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">11. Fixed an issue with World Boss Invasion Point Mode where Actual Rank and Damage Ratio could be different</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">12. World Boss Invasion &ndash; Ymir and Odin stages p&#108;ayer starting point has been changed</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">13. Fixed an issue with Co-Op Auto Repeat while using Quick Match that Pop-Up window does not pops up when there are no inventory slots left</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">14. Fixed an issue with Fandral&rsquo;s skill &lsquo;Fandral&rsquo;s Formation&rsquo; summoning 6 characters in Co-Op and World Boss Invasion.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">15. Fixed an issue with Shadowland where opponent&rsquo;s buff icon is hidden under their portrait.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">16. Fixed an issue with World Boss Black Dwarf mission where the camera view was closer than previous versions. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">17. Fixed an issue with World Boss and World Boss Dimension Rift that in certain cases, Doctor Strange and Enchantress&rsquo;s damage keeps being applied.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">18. Fixed an issue with Tier-2 Skills that boost Character&rsquo;s buffs not applying to Custom Gear&rsquo;s buff.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">19. Fixed an issue with acquired characters from Dimension Chests showing the rank of the character you own rather than the rank of the character you acquired.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">20. Labels have been improved to show New Characters, New Uniforms, and Improvements</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;<img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2017/01/101329/14.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">21. Fixed an issue with Energy recharge by S.H.I.E.L.D. Level Up showing negative numbers</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">22. If you acquired higher score than fixed score in Alliance Battle Normal Mode, your score will be set to the established limit of that mission.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">23. You will be able to see how much time is left in Special Mission Unlimited mode in the Battle preparation window.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana;\">24. Added Stats from Uniforms will now be applied in the Details window.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">25. Epic Quest Tutorial starts after clearing Story Mission 1-8 (If you finish Epic Quest tutorial, it will not appeal again)</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">26. Extreme Alliance Battle maximum points has been increased.&nbsp;</span></span></p>"
}